WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:06.819
Managing curriculum

00:00:06.869 --> 00:00:10.378
Open Content Creation, then Curriculum.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:18.999
Choose the class and the subject. The books for them are listed.

00:00:23.822 --> 00:00:31.580
Press Add Book. Choose the class and subject, enter the title and the edition, then press Add Book again.

00:00:45.301 --> 00:00:47.695
The book is created and listed.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:52.794
Click the book to see its chapters.

00:00:55.302 --> 00:00:59.426
Press Add Chapter, enter the title, and save it.

00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:13.228
Open the chapter and press Add Topic. Enter the title and save it.

00:01:26.659 --> 00:01:35.757
For a whole book, press Import Table of Contents. On the Manual Entry tab, you type or paste the chapters and topics.

00:01:39.668 --> 00:01:44.483
Curriculum ready
